  funding: |
    Information about our sponsors, grants, and funding partners.";s:8:"markdown";s:1773:"# The Digital Prompter
At the intersection of Peter Handke’s linguistic laboratory and the frontiers of artificial intelligence, the Residenztheater in München presents a radical reimagining of Kaspar for the digital age. This production transforms the rehearsal process into a real-time dialogue between the classic text and a Large Language Model, positioning the AI as the contemporary incarnation of Handke’s invisible prompters. As the protagonist navigates the grueling journey from a blank slate to a socialized subject, the LLM generates a shifting landscape of speech torture, mirroring the automated indoctrination of our modern algorithmic reality. By integrating cutting-edge machine learning into the very fabric of the performance, the project interrogates whether the silicon voices of today have replaced the societal structures of the past in shaping the boundaries of human consciousness. This is a visceral exploration of the colonization of the soul, where the stage becomes a site of collision between 1960s avant-garde theater and the predictive power of 21st-century code, asking what it truly means to be a person like somebody else was once in an era of synthetic thought.
# Language is a Program
In this groundbreaking production at the Residenztheater München, the "speech torture" of the 1960s becomes the algorithmic indoctrination of today. Witness the colonization of the soul through a live dialogue between a classic masterpiece and artificial intelligence.
# AI-Driven Socialization
Where Peter Handke’s linguistic laboratory meets the predictive power of 21st-century code at the Residenztheater. A visceral collision of human consciousness and algorithmic control that asks what it means to be a person in the age of the machine.";s:4:"slug";s:11:"the-project";s:4:"name";s:10:"project.md";s:8:"ordering";b:1;}s:7:"storage";a:6:{s:3:"key";s:11:"the-project";s:11:"storage_key";s:14:"02.the-project";s:8:"template";s:7:"project";s:17:"storage_timestamp";i:1774304240;s:8:"markdown";a:1:{s:0:"";a:1:{s:7:"project";i:1774304240;}}s:8:"checksum";s:32:"91ca9950bd326ec4bc460b6b819641a1";}}